<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal"># We know the relations between angles and norms. </Text-field>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal"></Text-field>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal"><Font encoding="UTF-8">In Au, angles are equal to 60\302\260. </Font></Text-field>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Atom is located at 0,0,0. </Text-field>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">And interatomic disance is 2.95 A. </Text-field>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal"></Text-field>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">From these data, we should be able to construct the primitive cell. </Text-field>
